{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:23:299","content":{"id":299,"title":"原则","content":[{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"设定边界"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"人的精力有限，不可能成为全领域的专家，一定要设定自己需要精进的领域，把有限的精力投入其中，而之外的东西要克制自己"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"问题导向"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以解决具体的问题为导向去搜集信息，而不是去各种平台接受信息流，太被动且效率太低了，我们需要化被动为主动"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"保持质疑"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于观点，我们一定要多问几句为什么，论据是什么？是有没有数据支撑？适用范围是什么？背景是什么？前提是什么？"}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"笔记的方法","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:275","type":"doc","id":275}},{"label":"收集篇，如何做筛选，获取高质量信息","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:297","type":"doc","id":297}},{"label":"原则","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:299","type":"doc","id":299}}],"prevPage":{"title":"审视自己和信息的关系","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:298","type":"doc","id":298}},"nextPage":{"title":"建议","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:300","type":"doc","id":300}},"createTime":1743909941340,"updateTime":1743910255426,"projectId":23},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743910255426}}